Page: Portfolios
Cat: 💼
Function: Manages user investment portfolios
Description: CRUD operations for portfolios with positions, performance tracking, currency conversion, and rebalancing. Supports multiple portfolios per user with drill-down into individual holdings.
API: GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/v1/portfolios/*
Output: Portfolio list, detail, positions, P&L, performance charts
Tuna: 7
